# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository. The site builds on Linux
# (Vercel), so committing CRLF would produce noisy cross-platform diffs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
